,{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなが大好き好き！！！(^ω^)！！！スキスキスキップ！！！るんるん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"髪型は、初心忘れずってことで"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ハーフツインなのよ！！ちゅいんちゅいん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ツインテール革命！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1周年おめでとケーキ！！カラフル"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2013/02/23/4844441/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"名前入りクッキーなのさっ！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひなは、どーれだっ？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"正解は、さくらんぼだよっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2013/02/23/4844441/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来てくださった方、ありがとうございます。\n応援テレパシーを送ってくれた方、ありがとうございます。\nみなさん、てんきゅ！！！！！！！ 感謝感謝"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みーんなの心に魔法をかけちゃうぞ？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからも、宜しくね！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ。今度の乃木どこで\n13日の金曜日PV流されるらしいっ見てね！！ばいぴょんっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"読んでくれてありがとう！！！"}],"source":"archive"}